  "Close = open + income + contributions + distributions − benefits − calls": "Clôture = ouverture + revenu + cotisations + distributions − prestations − appels",
  "Income = max(open, 0) × annual yield ÷ 12": "Revenu = max(ouverture, 0) × rendement annuel ÷ 12",
